# REQUIRES: verilator
# Pass splitting (--pass-split <class>:P): a multicycle class's lanes -- the
# isomorphic fanout-free cones of its logic (Driver/Inputs/lanes: eight lanes
# of one structure per leaf, each reading its own element of a register
# array, a key all share and its index as constants, its result read by its
# register and by a sum over the lanes; four counters of a generate block) --
# evaluated on shared lanes, one replica a pass, each result held from its
# pass to the end registers. Against the target (tb_late.sv), from zero
# state, with bubbles and stalled channels: P = 4, 8 and 3 (a span of 2 per
# pass), two copies, paged state, nested sequencers with a short lead, and
# the multicycle check on every run. The mutant (Inputs/lanes/top_mut.sv:
# lane 5 a shift of 2, not 3) is not of its lanes' structure: folded, its
# lanes' group has one replica less and matches its target; the unmutated simulator
# against the mutant target does not match (the harness sees one lane).
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/lanes
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p4 --static --bubbles --stage-levels 6 --pass-split Leaf:4 Leaf > %t/p4.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P4 < %t/p4.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/p4/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/p4/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p4/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p4/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p8 --static --bubbles --modulo --copies Leaf:2 --stage-levels 6 --pass-split Leaf:8 Leaf > %t/p8.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P8 < %t/p8.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/p8/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/p8/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p8/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p8/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/p3 --static --bubbles --modulo --stage-levels 6 --multicycle Leaf:2 --pass-split Leaf:3 Leaf > %t/p3.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=P3 < %t/p3.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=XDC3 < %t/p3/foldsim_multicycle.xdc
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/p3/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/p3/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/p3/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/p3/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+4 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/pg --static --bubbles --modulo --page 2 --stage-levels 6 --pass-split Leaf:4 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/pg/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/pg/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/pg/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/pg/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+5 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/nest --static --bubbles --nest --modulo --short-lead --copies Leaf:2 --page 2 --stage-levels 8 --pass-split Leaf:4 Leaf > /dev/null 2>&1
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/nest/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top.sv %t/nest/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/nest/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/nest/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+6 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# The mutant: folded, lane 5 stays out of its group; the unmutated P = 4
# simulator against the mutant target mismatches.
# RUN: foldsim --srcs top_mut.f --top Top --out %t/mut --static --bubbles --stage-levels 6 --pass-split Leaf:4 Leaf > %t/mut.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=MUT < %t/mut.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/mut/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top_mut.sv %t/mut/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/mut/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/mut/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+7 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s
# RUN: mkdir -p %t/x && %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --x-initial unique --top-module tb -DBUBBLES -Mdir %t/x/obj %S/Inputs/tb_late.sv top_mut.sv %t/p4/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/x.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/x/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+2 +bubble=30 +stall=20 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=DIFF
# P4: Leaf pass-split: 4 passes of {{[0-9]+}} host cycles, span {{[0-9]+}}
# P4: Leaf x4 state gap {{[0-9]+}} stages {{[0-9]+}} multicycle {{[0-9]+}} pass-split 4
# P4: Leaf pass-split 4: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} lane groups, {{[0-9]+}} replicas on {{[0-9]+}} lanes
# P8: Leaf pass-split 8: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} lane groups
# P3: Leaf pass-split: 3 passes of 2 host cycles, span 8
# P3: Leaf pass-split 3: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} lane groups
# XDC3: set_multicycle_path 8 -setup
# XDC3: # fsps_Leaf__: 3 passes of 2 host cycles
# XDC3: set_multicycle_path 2 -setup {{.*}}fsmc_Leaf__cap{{.*}}fsps_Leaf__hold
# XDC3: set_multicycle_path 2 -setup {{.*}}fsps_Leaf__hold{{.*}}fsmc_Leaf__end
# MUT: Leaf pass-split 4: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} lane groups
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# DIFF: {{^}}MISMATCH cycle
